{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Well, my name's {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Let me know if you need anything!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I might even help you,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but only if I
feel like it! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sen buraya yeni taşınan kişi
