EN:
Do you{{TAG:0003:0017:}} remember how to save?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yep, that's right.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Press {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}START{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
and then {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Save and quit{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}If you see {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Save and continue{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
that might be a more preferred
option, depending on what's up.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Anyway, if you don't save,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} all the
things you've done and memories
you've made {{TAG:0003:0028:}}totally just vanish!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So when you're leaving for good,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
make sure you end your game by
choosing {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Save and quit{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

