Sorun değil!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nasıl olsa giyinmek için
uğraştım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}şimdilik üstümde kalsın!{{TAG:000A:001B:010034003B00}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hum,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} así que, diciéndolo finamente,
te parece una caca de vaca.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No pasa nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no me enfado.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Agradezco que seas sincer{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} y eso{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}El caso es que {{TAG:0003:0025:}}le había cogido
cariño. Pienso llevarla un poco
más, digas lo que digas.{{TAG:000A:001B:010034003C00}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hımm.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Yani kıyafetim berbat diyorsun,
öyle mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Dert değil.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Kızmadım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Dürüst olup
doğruyu söylemen iyi hoş ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Belki gözüm alışır,{{TAG:0003:0025:}} o yüzden şimdilik
giymeye devam edeceğim! Sonuçta modayı
ben belirlerim, bilirsin!{{TAG:000A:001B:010034003C00}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Hier, diesen Fetzen hab ich als
Werbegeschenk dazubekommen.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Den schenk ich dir.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Aber nur, weil er mir zu klein ist.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Und jetzt probier ihn an, ich will
wissen, ob er dir überhaupt passt.{{TAG:0007:000F:}}{{TAG:000A:0001:35003600}}

